    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO'Donnellan & Joyce are delighted to bring to the market this substantial property, set on a large site in the main square of Mountbellew Town. \n\nComprising of a two storey house, adjoining outbuilding and two garages, the property requires modernisation, but may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, thus presenting an excellent opportunity for buyers seeking a restoration project with character and charm.\n\nPlans are available for development of existing dwelling together with 5 new dwellings.\n\nMountbellew is a small but growing town in County Galway about 30 miles from Galway city in the west, 18 miles from Athlone to the east, and 16 miles from Ballinasloe, all offering an extensive range of shopping, leisure, educational and transport amenities.\n\nIdeally positioned within in the centre of Mountbellew town centre, residents can enjoy easy access to local shops, cafés, bars, and amenities such as Castlegar River as well as park walks around the renowned Mountbellew Estate. \n\nContact Jamie Costello for details.\n\nSOLICITOR WITH CARRIAGE OF SALE: Liam Staunton, 11 Sea Road, Galway, H91 X384\n\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact. Whilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Built c. 1920 - Plans are available for development of existing dwelling together with 5 new dwellings.</li><li> Substantial property on a large site in the main square.</li><li> Two-storey house, adjoining outbuilding and two garages.</li><li> Offers excellent restoration opportunity.</li><li> May qualify for the Vacant Property Grant, subject to eligibility.</li><li> Ideally located close to shops, cafés, bars and local amenities.</li><li> Galway City 30 miles, Athlone 18 miles and 16 miles to Ballinasloe.</ul>"
